{"sourceUrl":"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0815/c27446a601237/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.882123+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0815/c27446a601237/page.htm","html":"<div><p><a href=\"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0815/c27446a601237/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0815/c27446a601237/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0815/c27446a601237/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>组合数学中心</span><span><span>接收</span></span></span></span><span>2027</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生</span></p><p><span><span><span>（含直博生）</span><span><span>预报名通知</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>组合数学中心接收</span><span>2027</span><span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>含直博生</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>网上预报名系统已开通，现将相关安排通知如下：</span></span></span></p><ol><li><p><span>招收类型</span></p></li></ol><p><span>学术学位硕士研究生、直博生</span></p><ol start=\"2\"><li><p><span>报名条件</span></p></li></ol><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span>符合《南开大学</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名通知》中的基本条件</span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>本科三年级在读生</span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span>2027</span><span><span><span>年应届毕业生</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>，成绩优异，达到所在高校推荐免试生要求，能获得所在高校的推免生资格，专业不限；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>热忱于科学事业，具有较好的科研潜力；</span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span>英语水平符合以下任一项：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）通过全国大学英语六级考试（六级成绩</span></span><span><span>425</span><span>分及以上）或通过全国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀（四级成绩</span></span><span><span>550</span><span>分及以上）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>90</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>IELTS</span><span>（</span></span><span><span>A</span><span>类</span></span><span><span>/</span><span>学术类）成绩</span></span><span><span>6</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩在</span></span><span><span>310</span><span>以上，</span></span><span><span>GMAT</span><span>成绩在</span></span><span><span>640</span><span>以上；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>5</span><span>）英语专业四级（及以上）考试合格。</span></span></p><ol start=\"3\"><li><p><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span><span>流程</span></span></span></p></li></ol><p><a href=\"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0815/c27446a601237/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>即日起至</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>日早</span></span></span><span><span><span>8:00</span></span><span><span>前登陆南开大学研究生招生网（</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/</span></span><span><span>）进行报名。申请直博的同学务必提前与意向导师联系，并在报名时，同步将申报博导的姓名发送至邮箱</span></span></span><span><span><span>wuyan@nankai.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>完成系统报名的同学需于</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>31</span></span><span><span>日早</span></span></span><span><span><span>8:00</span></span><span><span>前通过邮箱提交如下材料（注：所有材料按以下排列顺序制成一个</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文档。</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>名称、邮件主题名称格式均为：“学校全称</span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>学生姓名</span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>申请类型”）</span></span></span><span><span>:</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>本科成绩单和专业排名证明</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>需加盖学校教务部门公章</span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span>;</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>《南开大学</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试研究生报名信息表》</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>网报系统打印，需本人签字</span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span>;</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>符合要求的英语考试成绩单复印件</span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>其他证明材料，包括：获奖证书复印件；本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性成果等。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>另外，申请直博的同学，联系好意向导师后，须准备两封专家推荐函</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>专家推荐函模板见附件，须分别由两位所报名学科专业领域内的教授或相当专业技术职称以上的专家推荐签字</span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span>,</span><span>签字扫描版于考核前单独发送至邮箱 </span></span><span><span>wuyan</span></span><span><span>@nankai.edu.cn,</span><span>邮件主题需注明“学校全称</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>学生姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>直博</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>专家推荐函”</span></span><span><span>,</span><span>推荐函纸质版请妥善保存，提交时间另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>面试考核安排</span></span></span></p><p><span>我们将通过邮件通知最终入围面试考核环节的考生。面试时间另行通知。</span></p><ol start=\"4\"><li><p><span><span>注意事项</span></span></p></li></ol><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>请关注南开大学研究生招生网站和中心网站通知，以上内容如有变化，以最新通知为准。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>我校推免生报名信息采集系统仅用于前期报名登记和信息采集，系统内的学科专业仅供信息采集时使用。</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年推免生实际接收学科专业以我校公布的</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年研究生招生目录为准。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>考生正式的推免报名申请仍须在教育部规定时间登录教育部全国推免服务系统，完成填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>考生必须保证提交的报名信息和申请材料的真实性和准确性，对在报名过程中弄虚作假的考生，一经发现，取消其相应资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>本通知内容与上级教育主管部门日后下达文件不符的，以上级教育主管部门下达的最新文件为准。</span></span></span></p><ol start=\"5\"><li><p><span><span>联系方式</span></span></p></li></ol><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>022-23502180</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>wuyan@nankai.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>地址：天津市南开区卫津路</span><span>94</span><span><span><span>号</span><span><span></span></span><span>南开大学组合数学中心</span></span></span><span><span>207</span></span><span>办公室</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://cfc.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/fd/c8/6ed684684c00abb4d81029445ce6/fa1e6707-d3c6-4509-acd0-e115654ce56d.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2027年申请攻读南开大学博士学位研究生专家推荐函.docx</a></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>组合数学中心 </span></p><p><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>15</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"d12ff92e253152346e9f402ccf4cdef2badf71e770fe63dc6e35ca342b26ba4c","textLength":1434,"sourceSha256":"66913ba70ed70a10cafd4ca60bf09205e0f2b2374eb08b2eaed3852738ae3317","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-72ba0b97b0bb5707605b","title":"2026年南开大学组合数学中心接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.882123+00:00"}
